<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="effectiveDate" id="id4903807c-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb"><heading class="centered smallCaps">Effective Date</heading><p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">Section effective <date date="1986-01-01">Jan. 1, 1986</date>, see <ref href="/us/pl/99/198/s1631">section 1631 of Pub. L. 99–198</ref>, set out as a note under <ref href="/us/usc/t7/s4801">section 4801 of this title</ref>.</p>
